{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-binghatti-corner","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"binghatti-corner-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Binghatti Corner is a chic project by renowned developer Binghatti Developers, with 634 luxury residences, commercial and office spaces in one of Dubai's best neighborhoods Jumeirah Village Circle. The residential development with 1 basement, 4 podium and 29 residential floors will feature 1 and 2-bedroom designer apartments and luxury penthouses, as well as 69 office spaces and 14 retail spaces.The project offers a variety of apartment types, providing a comfortable living space for every resident. The interiors of each residence are carefully planned and equipped with modern sanitary ware, furniture and fittings.Each apartment is equipped with a private balcony offering a gorgeous view of JVC Parks. Penthouse owners will be able to appreciate the private pool from the comfort of their apartment.Residents have access to the communal pool, gyms, yoga and meditation areas, organized recreation areas, parks and gardens. A high level of security is guaranteed by security guards and video surveillance systems, and there are parking lots for residents and guests.Binghatti Corner residential complex is located in the Jumeirah Village Circle neighborhood. In the immediate vicinity there are all necessary infrastructure facilities: shopping centers and supermarkets, educational and medical institutions, cultural and entertainment facilities. There are also many bus stops in the neighborhood of the complex.","price":850000,"title":"Binghatti Corner","bitrix":{"id":423,"pf_id":"are.2.12203","source":null,"project_id":"Binghatti Corner","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Binghatti Corner","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Binghatti","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/